6-feature integration (fitdraw): G2 holds all gains (s3 62.9, s6
70.9, s7 68.8; pickup scenarios bit-identical); G4a: hard3 0.793
and hard1 0.559 now SHARPEN, but home10 0.642 vs bound 0.713.
